     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "This is with a PostgreSQL backend, correct?",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "I would be interest to see if other backends exhibit the same behavior. ",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Can you clarify what you mean by \"ingesting a large object with 1000+ files\"? Does that mean you are creating a container and adding 1000+ binaries to that container?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
