     "content": [
      {
       "text": "When trying to access the object afterwards, I see the same error (stacktrace attached).",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "I tried skipping the first 295 files and that file ingests without problem and the ingest continues, and I get the same error on the 299th file that is processed.",
       "type": "text"
