      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>The error happens at this line in our Hydra ingest tool:</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/pulibrary/plum/blob/master/app/jobs/ingest_mets_job.rb#L61\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://github.com/pulibrary/plum/blob/master/app/jobs/ingest_mets_job.rb#L61</a></p>\n\n<p>I'm working to isolate this issue and reproduce with a shell script to make it easier for others to debug this error.  But so far haven't been successful.</p>",
     "created": "23/Jun/16 10:20 AM",
     "id": "16898",
     "jsdPublic": true,
