      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I've tried a few different things, and have only been able to reproduce the error with the configuration I was using:</p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li>Using MySQL instead of PostgreSQL worked without errors</li>\n\t<li>Ingesting on my local machine with PostgreSQL 9.4 worked without errors</li>\n\t<li>I'm currently testing PostgreSQL 9.5 (instead of 9.3) to see if that resolves the problem</li>\n</ul>\n",
