     "body": "<p>This problem was fixed by using PostgreSQL 9.4 or 9.5.  I've updated the wiki docs to indicate these versions should be used with Modeshape5: <a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Configuring+JDBC+Object+Store\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FEDORA4x/Configuring+JDBC+Object+Store</a></p>",
