  "description": "<p>Using the modeshape5 branch, when ingesting a large object with 1000+ files, I am seeing an exception on the 299th file: </p>\n\n<p>Error: STATUS: 500 org.modeshape.persistence.relational.RelationalProviderException: java.nio.charset.MalformedInputException: Input length = 1<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.persistence.relational.DefaultStatements.readDocument(DefaultStatements.java:192)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.persistence.relational.DefaultStatements.getById(DefaultStatements.java:109)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.persistence.relational.RelationalDb.lambda$get$9(RelationalDb.java:148)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.persistence.relational.RelationalDb.runWithConnection(RelationalDb.java:358)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.persistence.relational.RelationalDb.get(RelationalDb.java:148)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.schematic.SchematicDb.getEntry(SchematicDb.java:154)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.cache.document.LocalDocumentStore.get(LocalDocumentStore.java:87)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.cache.document.WorkspaceCache.documentFor(WorkspaceCache.java:184)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.cache.document.WorkspaceCache.documentFor(WorkspaceCache.java:203)<br/>\n\tat org.modeshape.jcr.cache.document.WorkspaceCache.getNode(WorkspaceCache.ja...</p>\n\n<p>When trying to access the object afterwards, I see the same error (stacktrace attached).</p>\n\n<p>I tried skipping the first 295 files and that file ingests without problem and the ingest continues, and I get the same error on the 299th file that is processed.</p>",
